      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like this feature in the simple way of, \"Show a user until I leave the instance/reboot the game.\"\n\nThe only reliable method for me to use avatar blocking is the custom safety + download size. It would be preferable if I could just always run my safety settings, but then show avatars just for an instance. \n\nThe show avatar feature eventually defeats the safety settings since you manually show people and it stays on. It's too manual and unreliable, and for some reason I still see people doing it.",
